{
  "id": "ISA.59",
  "number": "59",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 59",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "59",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 59"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "59",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't think that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is too weak to save you or too deaf to hear your call for help! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is because of your sins that he doesn't hear you. It is your sins that separate you from God when you try to worship him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are guilty of lying, violence, and murder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You go to court, but you haven't got justice on your side. You depend on lies to win your case. You carry out your plans to hurt others. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The evil plots you make are as deadly as the eggs of a poisonous snake. Crush an egg, out comes a snake! But your plots will do you no good — they are as useless as clothing made of cobwebs! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.5+ISA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.5",
              "ISA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.15+ROM.3.16+ROM.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 3.15–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are always planning something evil, and you can hardly wait to do it. You never hesitate to murder innocent people. You leave ruin and destruction wherever you go, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and no one is safe when you are about. Everything you do is unjust. You follow a crooked path, and no one who walks that path will ever be safe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people say, “Now we know why God does not save us from those who oppress us. We hope for light to walk by, but there is only darkness, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and we grope about like blind people. We stumble at noon, as if it were night, as if we were in the dark world of the dead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We are frightened and distressed. We long for God to save us from oppression and wrong, but nothing happens.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", our crimes against you are many. Our sins accuse us. We are well aware of them all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have rebelled against you, rejected you, and refused to follow you. We have oppressed others and turned away from you. Our thoughts are false; our words are lies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Justice is driven away, and right cannot come near. Truth stumbles in the public square, and honesty finds no place there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is so little honesty that those who stop doing evil find themselves the victims of crime.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has seen this, and he is displeased that there is no justice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.63.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 63.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is astonished to see that there is no one to help the oppressed. So he will use his own power to rescue them and to win the victory. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eph 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Thes 5.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will wear justice like a coat of armour and saving power like a helmet. He will clothe himself with the strong desire to set things right and to punish and avenge the wrongs that people suffer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will punish his enemies according to what they have done, even those who live in distant lands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From east to west everyone will fear him and his great power. He will come like a rushing river, like a strong wind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 11.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to his people, “I will come to Jerusalem to defend you and to save all of you that turn from your sins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I make a covenant with you: I have given you my power and my teachings to be yours for ever, and from now on you are to obey me and teach your children and your descendants to obey me for all time to come.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
